OL,3,GNEWSAFires still burn in charred
OL,4,Alandscape as focus turns to wildfire
OL,5,Aprevention
OL,6,
OL,7,FAs we're driving in a pickup truck to
OL,8,Fsee the aftermath of a huge fire which
OL,9,Fburnt for more than a month in the
OL,10,FCairngorms, I spot fresh smoke coming
OL,11,Ffrom the ground.
OL,13,FMy guide - RSPB Scotland's site manager
OL,14,Fat the Abernethy nature reserve, Ben
OL,15,FOliver-Jones - puts the vehicle in
OL,16,Freverse and we jump out to see what's
OL,17,Fhappening.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
PN,42802
SC,0002
CT,3,C
